    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bolbitīnus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the city of
			Bolbitine</i>, now <i>Rosetta</i>, <i>in</i>
			
			
			<i>Lower Egypt</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ostium,</span>”
				<i>the Rosetta mouth of the Nile</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					5, 10, 11, § 64</span></i>
			.—Later collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bolbitĭcus</span></b> , a, um: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ostium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					1, 9, 9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Amm. 22, 15, 10</span></i>.</div>
